00:00:05.567 --> 00:00:09.000
It's time for "12 Days
of Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.234 --> 00:00:12.334
-♪ "12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters" ♪

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:17.834
