00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:29.868
Come on over!

00:01:29.868 --> 00:01:32.133
Aw, look at you.

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:34.367
Hello. What is your name?

00:01:34.367 --> 00:01:35.934
-Karina.
-Karina, where are you from?

00:01:35.934 --> 00:01:37.968
-Jersey.
-Yeah! Jersey!

00:01:37.968 --> 00:01:40.200
Alright, good.
Karina from Jersey.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.200
