in Jersey wearing this.

00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:51.734
-I know. I'm gonna
go to dinner in this.

00:01:51.734 --> 00:01:53.033
-You should.
Would you like to try it on?

00:01:53.033 --> 00:01:54.334
-Can I?
-Yes, please.

00:01:54.334 --> 00:01:56.334
I think we'd love to see it.
This is gonna be amazing.

00:01:56.334 --> 00:01:57.968
I think it's gorgeous.

00:01:57.968 --> 00:01:59.467
There...

00:01:59.467 --> 00:02:00.734
♪♪

00:02:00.734 --> 00:02:02.968
