a super model on our show.

00:02:13.901 --> 00:02:15.834
It's unbelievable.
Gorgeous.

00:02:15.834 --> 00:02:18.200
Thank you so much for
being here! I appreciate it.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.534
Another round of applause
for our winner.

00:02:19.534 --> 00:02:20.734
You can leave if you want.

00:02:20.734 --> 00:02:22.701
You can stay.
Whatever you feel like doing.

00:02:22.701 --> 00:02:23.968
